  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comprehensive Supply Chain Engagement and Multi-Stakeholder Initiative for Eradicating Child Labor in the Indian Mica Mining and Processing Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Establish a fair, responsible and sustainable mica mineral supply chain in India&#xbf;s&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;four mica-producing states (Jharkhand, Bihar, Rajasthan and Andhra Pradesh), free of child labor and unacceptable working conditions, involving civil society organizations, public authorities and all stakeholders within the supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
